88.88 coinbase - 1.0 gas-price payment - 305.31898 returned = 4.80102 ETH), which may be gas/dust and is not a claim of retention; Yoink's remainder is about -0.0009 ETH (its priority fees). No builder->bot refund transfers in blocks 17007838-17007856 (block + trace scan). In 17007842 beaverbuild.org took 689.235 ETH gross and paid the proposer 689.017 (margin 0.218); about 99.9% of the auction money reached proposers."},"title":"SushiSwap RouteProcessor2","sub_label":null,"evidence_strength":"high","evidence_strength_basis":"Yoink's route matches Trust's except the fake-pool address; Trust's max fee below block base fee","public_ordering":null,"comparison_policy":null,"caveat":null,"headline":false,"timeline_publication_gaps":[]}